WEBVTT

00:02:29.329 --> 00:02:33.329
formless bodies that all coexist
as one colorful mass.

00:02:34.246 --> 00:02:38.038
I'd always pictured Allah as a kind
of fascistic punisher who built

00:02:38.038 --> 00:02:39.663
the universe on rigid lines.

00:02:39.996 --> 00:02:41.371
But the more I read the Koran,

00:02:41.371 --> 00:02:43.746
it kind of seen that Allah envisioned
the universe in

00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:47.538
the same model of quantum physics,
chaotic and full of multiplicity.

00:02:48.246 --> 00:02:52.996
The more I read, the more I found when I
first learned about whirling dervishes,

00:02:52.996 --> 00:02:56.954
YouTube, of all places, was the space
I could most directly see myself.

00:02:56.954 --> 00:02:58.079
And I couldn't believe the stuff

00:02:58.079 --> 00:03:02.579
I was seeing Muslims wearing big billowing
white skirts that would outdo